      "short": "A thermal cup of borscht spiked with vodka, ladled out by Gorący Kubek, the cook at the Whirling-in-Rags. It counts as alcohol.",
      "details": "Gorący Kubek doesn't speak your language, but he happily shares his brew, and if you egg him on he pours half a bottle of vodka into the pot. Harry describes it as the special strike brew the Union uses. Like other alcohol it boosts your Physique skills while hurting Morale.",
