    {
      "id": "wirral-untethered-die",
      "term": "Wirrâl Untethered die",
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A custom role-playing die you can order from the Novelty Dicemaker: alligator jawbone cast in black resin, themed on ice, death and loss.",
      "details": "Neha, the Novelty Dicemaker in the Doomed Commercial Area, makes a die for whatever role-playing system you name. Ask for one for Wirrâl Untethered (the bleak setting of an unfinished radio game by the studio Fortress Accident) and she designs a variation of the standard Wirrâl die that swaps its plant motifs for ice and death. It costs seven réal and is ready eight hours after you order it.\n\nIt feels icy to hold; through the dark resin you can see a nugget of bone from an alligator's jaw.",
      "seeAlso": [
        "doomed-commercial-area",
        "cursed-die",
        "real"
      ]
