    {
      "id": "yellow-man-mug",
      "term": "Yellow Man Mug",
      "short": "A broken mug with a racist caricature of 'the yellow man' frolicking in saffron, which you can dig out of the trash container in the Whirling's yard.",
      "details": "It was thrown away in the same container as some clothes worth investigating, so it works as a clue: you can show it to people around Martinaise and see who reacts. Trying to have deep thoughts about it mostly gets you told to get back to your case.",
      "spoiler": "It matches the collection of colonial mugs in the apartment of Gary, the Cryptofascist, pointing to him as the one who has been dumping things in the Whirling's trash.",
      "seeAlso": [
        "whirling-in-rags"
      ]
